    "message": "FELIX-6807 - Record 8.0.0 in the main and distribution changelogs\n\nBoth changelogs stopped at 7.0.5 while 8.0.0 was being released, so neither\nrecorded the move to framework 8.0.0, the removal of the OSGi security\nlayer it brings, or the Java 11 requirement. The distribution also gained\nGogo Runtime 1.2.0.\n\nmain.distribution/doc/changelog_main.txt is a copy of main's changelog that\nships inside the archive, so it is refreshed alongside.\n\nThese entries land after the artifacts were staged, so the 8.0.0 archives\nthemselves do not carry them; they are here for the repository record and\nfor the next release.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
